1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
We're SARcastic Scientists, from Islamabad.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,703
Pakistan's glacial lakes can burst, and they fill in summer,

3
00:00:07,743 --> 00:00:10,730
when cloud hides them from optical satellites.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,990
NISAR radar, from NASA and ISRO, sees through cloud.

5
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:24,747
We built SARtale: one plain status for every watched lake, thirty-nine so far,

6
00:00:24,787 --> 00:00:26,850
and anyone can add more.
